## Description

We’re adding support for WebMCP in the ChatGPT desktop app’s built-in browser and ChatGPT Sites.  When you visit a compatible website, ChatGPT or Codex can automatically use it to complete your task.  Update to the latest version of the ChatGPT desktop app, then just ask Codex to https://t.co/XCGXUTRotN

